  "content": "\n\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fDeez\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/dtenjvtzsu0sctnijrxti/banner-copy.png?rlkey=0kvg48ehljijw2t24gk612dan&dl=1\" alt=\"partner\" width=\"672\" height=\"198\"></a></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>材質包功能：</strong></p>\n<p>這個極簡風格的材質包專注於改善 Minecraft 介面的視覺一致性和功能性，且不會影響遊戲機制。</p>\n<p><strong>修復與一致性：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>物品材質拼接修復：</strong>確保物品材質顯示流暢無縫，避免出現故障或視覺不一致的問題。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>介面增強：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>編號快捷欄：</strong>在每個快捷欄槽位上標明清晰的數字，輕鬆追蹤您的物品。</li>\n<li><strong>橘色快捷欄選取框：</strong>以顯眼的橘色邊框高亮顯示您選中的物品，提升可見度。</li>\n<li><strong>深色介面：</strong>採用時尚的深色主題使用者介面，呈現更整潔、現代的風格。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Deez Fps 黑色介面&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/deez-fps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge Deez FPS</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/deez-fps-vulkan-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge Deez FPS [VULKAN EDITION]</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fdeez-fps%252fversion%252fv11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth Deez FPS</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fdeez-fps-vulkan-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth Deez FPS [VULKAN EDITION]</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/uuvgyy5h1e9ole0fqkpog/2024-09-05_10.28.55.png?rlkey=85j56hg4o09e644zp53wc8fbz&st=y5t3vhpj&dl=1\" alt=\"透明\" width=\"1513\" height=\"851\"></p>",
